# CODEOWNERS — merge authority, mechanically enforced
#
# This file is the machine-readable form of the role charters in agents/.
# If a charter and this file disagree, one of them is a defect — fix both.
#
# Rules:
#   - No path is unowned. A CI check fails if a file matches no rule here.
#   - Later rules override earlier ones, so specific paths come last.
#   - Nobody merges their own pull request, including the CTO and Founder.
#
# Teams are placeholders until the contributor base exists; they map to the
# roles in agents/README.md. See docs/engineering/BRANCH_STRATEGY.md.

